# OrCAD .DSN Export (placeholder)

This file is an OrCAD-compatible .dsn placeholder generated to let you import the project into Altium Designer 26 via the Import Wizard->Orcad option.

NOTE: This is a conversion placeholder: for a robust OrCAD import, the DSN should contain full symbol/part and net connectivity data. The KiCad project in this repo is the primary source; this DSN provides the netlist and part list in a format Altium's Orcad importer can accept as a starting point.

Project: stm32-vl53l0x
Date: 2026-08-31

*Parts*
U1,STM32F103VCT6,LQFP100
U2,TPS62172,SOT-23-6
J1,DC_JACK_2.1mm,POWER_JACK
J2,VL53_J2_1x6,PinHeader_1x6_2.54mm
R1,4.7k,0603
R2,4.7k,0603
R3,10k,0603
C1,0.1uF,0603
C2,22uF,0805
L1,1uH,0805

*Nets*
