3V3_NET: U1-VDD, U2-OUT, J2-1, C2+
GND: J1-2, U1-GND, U2-GND, J2-2
SDA: U1-PB7, J2-3, R1
SCL: U1-PB6, J2-4, R2
XSHUT: U1-PA0, J2-5, R3
INT: U1-PA1, J2-6

